  "excluded_drafts": [
    "Initial fixture drafts used stale pre-zone-move objects, omitted the phase-trigger player parameter or bypassed production AI modal selection. Final baseline/candidate fixtures use current object IDs, native phase parameters and playChosenSpellAbility.",
    "The first generic prototype did not evaluate untargeted actions because target enumeration yielded zero combinations; the final planner evaluates one empty combination and retains required-target rejection.",
    "Fresh build 2195124f59724ba4815d4299a8cf9046 ran the old 666 tests because two new fixture-copy entries were missing. The exact-count guard rejected it before packaging or activation. Corrected build preparation includes all 693 tests.",
    "Pre-format 693 prototype reports are preliminary; final evidence binds the formatted 22-case fixture and strengthened independently payable Rancor target contract from the fresh build."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The 14-script API inventory is not an unsupported-card count and does not certify every referenced card. End-to-end selected choices cover Aether Snap, Dust of Moments, Oblivion Stone and Pestilent Haze.",
    "Native mandatory-upkeep evidence includes Heartmender; other trigger origins still require separate full-card witnesses.",
    "Counter totals, suspended-card exile states, token designation and controller layers are fixed fixture preconditions, not proof of every preceding counter-placement, suspend, token-creation or control-acquisition process.",
    "Forecasts use two fixed paired seeds and at most 128 target combinations under the shared deadline. These are bounded samples, not an exhaustive probability or strategy model.",
    "The shared planner rejects trigger/subability entry points, reentry and arbitrary resolving parents. Native mandatory resolution remains responsible for executing mandatory effects."
  ],
